  "narrative": {
    "intro": "Bath Iron Works shows $2B in federal contract obligations for FY2026 to date. Bath Iron Works received 18 awards so far this fiscal year, with an average award size of $111M. Bath Iron Works obligations are down 16.0% year over year. Bath Iron Works has recorded obligations in Ship Building and Repairing totaling $2B for FY2026 to date, while other NAICS entries show only small, single-line amounts such as $37.6K for Measuring, Dispensing, and Other Pumping Equipment Manufacturing and $27K for Convention and Trade Show Organizers. Bath Iron Works obligations by fiscal year rose from $1B in FY21 to $2.4B in FY25, then show $2.1B in FY24 and $2.1B in FY23 before the FY26 to-date total of $2B. Bath Iron Works totals are partial for the current fiscal year, and the listed award values in market tables are total contract values rather than current-year obligations.",
